# TDD worktree base-SHA marker (per-worktree, never commit)
.tdd-base-sha
.tdd-issue
# The TDD working files, generated from the versioned templates next to them.
# Ignored rather than merely "do not commit this": the phase agents stage with
# `git add -A`, so a rule nobody can enforce is a rule that gets broken — the
# spec reached a feature branch that way once, and only a history rewrite got it
# out. An ignored file cannot be swept in at all.
tdd/feature.md
tdd/REVIEW.md
graphify-out/20*/
# Regenerated by `graphify update .` (AST-only, no API cost). 3.6 MB of blob per
# run, no consumer outside a local session, and a 63k-line diff for a directory
# rename — which no pull request can honestly carry.
graphify-out/graph.json
graphify-out/graph.html
